    {
      "atom_id": "7f9f216b-c4ce-5517-9a90-1b1708747cea",
      "excerpt": "We describe the selection of reduced chlorhexidine susceptibility during chlorhexidine use in a patient with two episodes",
      "exact_or_token_supported": true
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "08abd00f-5735-5150-88e3-aa51ade289ca",
      "excerpt": "An 18-year-old man undergoing infantry basic training at Fort Benning, GA",
      "exact_or_token_supported": true
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "cbd9cd76-455a-5601-a85a-d7e089de2a4b",
      "excerpt": "The patient was diagnosed with a cutaneous abscess without joint involvement and underwent incision and drainage.",
      "exact_or_token_supported": true
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "e235ac4c-0e8e-5b04-af57-3a8d2978a3ed",
      "excerpt": "the patient was treated with a 10-day course of twice-daily double-strength TMP-SMX",
      "exact_or_token_supported": true
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "9d8acd08-883e-54ac-9d83-23629a3c6846",
      "excerpt": "complete resolution of his abscess within 14 days",
      "exact_or_token_supported": true
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "89a37723-ebcb-5007-b4d4-5f4a77530d39",
      "excerpt": "Nine weeks after his initial presentation, the patient returned to the clinic.",
      "exact_or_token_supported": true
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "fa2619a9-a93e-5f0d-8d25-1c1c821919d8",
      "excerpt": "he reported using the agent every other week throughout his training",
      "exact_or_token_supported": true
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "21ae0e37-e84b-54fc-9b42-9960f522ecef",
      "excerpt": "qacA                          Negative               Positive",
      "exact_or_token_supported": true
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "b82899b4-8215-5e74-b7d7-5225798a4f18",
      "excerpt": "Levofloxacin                Susceptible            Resistant",
      "exact_or_token_supported": true
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "679cdc83-81f8-5223-8389-5c6491f4022c",
      "excerpt": "methicillin-susceptible S. aureus strain (ST30)",
      "exact_or_token_supported": true
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "ac44c687-c5ce-58e0-8568-c3a094aef96f",
      "excerpt": "the MIC for the C01 isolate was 0.3",
      "exact_or_token_supported": true
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "599e2cb7-bdb3-5d0c-bb4b-e1336afdcb5f",
      "excerpt": "Both clinical isolates underwent chlorhexidine susceptibility testing.",
      "exact_or_token_supported": true
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "95abe031-5f08-5c06-a7ec-c4ca93ba51b0",
      "excerpt": "the C01 and C02 norA promoters were identical in nucleotide composition",
      "exact_or_token_supported": true
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "9d91ca1f-52e2-57dc-8876-47327c431d99",
      "excerpt": "C02 isolate actively expressed the qacA gene",
      "exact_or_token_supported": true
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "91131733-3a9d-558e-b7c7-e5dc4febaec4",
      "excerpt": "six of the qacA residues were observed in the qacA gene from C02",
      "exact_or_token_supported": true
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "18606c51-f604-58c2-822b-0577d5f0d248",
      "excerpt": "TABLE 2 pSK1-like plasmid PCR primer panel",
      "exact_or_token_supported": true
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "493c7fe2-ac2f-5805-844c-c2a3191cef76",
      "excerpt": "only the primer pair that encompassed the qacA gene (primer pair 9) yielded a PCR amplicon",
      "exact_or_token_supported": true
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "0edfc4ea-8071-5450-b08f-0913db429556",
      "excerpt": "subjected to Pacific Biosciences RS II SMRT whole-genome sequencing",
      "exact_or_token_supported": true
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "754ae792-f898-5b45-8891-1e67267646a6",
      "excerpt": "we observed >140 single nucleotide polymorphisms (SNPs) between the two chromosomes",
      "exact_or_token_supported": true
    },
    {
      "atom_id": "0919b43b-7703-5dd9-a761-0295b7647d64",
      "excerpt": "These SNPs result in an S84L amino acid mutation in GyrA and an F80Y mutation in GrlA",
